    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34341" root="فقع" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُقَّاعَةٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُمَّانَةٌ</span>, sing. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَقَاقِيعُ</span>, (TA,) which
signifies The <i>bubbles that rise upon water,</i> (S, O,
K, TA,) and <i>upon wine,</i> (O,) [&amp;c.,] <i>round,</i> [or
<i>globular.</i>] (TA,) <i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوَارِير</span> [or <i>vessels of glass</i>].
(S, O, TA.)

